title: The Barricades
subtitle: One of the risen districts is close to breaking.
view-if: crisis_october = 1 and e23_rising_phase = 1 and e23_oct_alive >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.octTick(Q.crisis_time + 1);
Q.e23_weak_d = RG.e22.octWeakest() || 0;
Q.e23_weak_name = Q.e23_weak_d ? RG.dname(Q.e23_weak_d) : 'the weakest district';
Q.e23_depot_ok = 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Barricades

The reports come in by courier every few hours. [+ e23_weak_name +] is the worst: the hundreds there are short of ammunition, and the Reichswehr has brought up field guns.

- @reinforce: Send the reserve hundreds to [+ e23_weak_name +].
- @depot: Take a railway arms depot.
- @kitchens: Feed the strike.

@reinforce
subtitle: [+ e23_weak_name +] will hold longer. The others get nothing.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.e23_weak_d) { RG.district(Q.e23_weak_d, {guards: 2, militancy: 5}); }
Q.e23_oct_arms = Math.max(0, Q.e23_oct_arms - 1);
RG.e22.octLines();
!}

The reserve goes by lorry at night, with the last of the machine-gun belts.

@depot
subtitle: More rifles for everyone. The apparatus thinks it will probably work.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_depot_ok = Math.random() < 0.65 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_depot_ok) { Q.e23_oct_arms += 3; } else if (Q.e23_weak_d) { RG.district(Q.e23_weak_d, {guards: -0.5}); }
RG.e22.octLines();
!}

[? if e23_depot_ok = 1 : The hundreds take the depot at the goods station before the guards are awake. The rifles are handed out from the wagons. ?][? if e23_depot_ok = 0 : The depot has been emptied the day before. The hundreds lose men on the way back. ?]

@kitchens
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The strikers' families eat, and the strike holds.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no money.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.e23_oct_bonus += 1.5;
Q.worker_support += 3;
RG.e22.octLines();
!}

The control committees requisition the flour in the mills and the potatoes in the station yards. Every workers' district has a kitchen by the evening.
